      "lines": [
        "819. 一个人走路的速度是5公里/小时，$\\frac{3}{4}$小时，$\\frac{1}{2}$小时，$\\frac{1}{10}$",
        "小时各走几公里？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "820",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "820. 长方体的三个度量等于$\\frac{2}{5}$分米、$\\frac{3}{5}$分米和$\\frac{25}{4}$分米，求它",
        "的体积."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "821",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "821. 把下列各数化成两个分数的积：",
        "1) $\\frac{1}{6}$； 2) $\\frac{3}{4}$； 3) $\\frac{9}{8}$； 4) $\\frac{4}{8}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "822",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "822. 一叠纸共有250张. 翻印一个手稿用了一叠纸的$\\frac{3}{5}$，翻",
        "印另一个手稿用了剩余纸张的$\\frac{4}{5}$. 第二个手稿用了多少",
        "张纸？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "823",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "823. 哥哥和妹妹用90戈比买了一本书. 哥哥付了这本书价",
        "的$\\frac{3}{10}$，妹妹付了其余的钱. 妹妹付了多少戈比？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "824",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "824. 把下列每个乘数化成假分数，然后作乘法：",
        "1) $1\\frac{3}{5}\\cdot3\\frac{3}{4}$； 3) $3\\frac{5}{6}\\cdot1\\frac{7}{23}$；",
        "2) $1\\frac{3}{4}\\cdot1\\frac{5}{7}$； 4) $2\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot2\\frac{2}{15}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "825",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "825. 作乘法：",
        "1) $1\\frac{2}{7}\\cdot1\\frac{1}{4}$； 4) $2\\frac{3}{4}\\cdot\\frac{4}{11}$； 7) $-1\\frac{2}{3}\\cdot(-2\\frac{2}{5})$；",
        "2) $4\\frac{2}{3}\\cdot\\frac{2}{5}$； 5) $3\\frac{1}{4}\\cdot4$； 8) $-7\\frac{3}{11}\\cdot2\\frac{19}{40}$；",
        "3) $\\frac{4}{9}\\cdot2\\frac{3}{4}$； 6) $10\\cdot5\\frac{2}{5}$."
      ]
    },
